  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{v}}-\\frac{1}{15}=\\frac{1}{-10} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{v}=-30 \\mathrm{~cm}$\n$m=\\frac{-30}{-15}=2$, image size $=4 \\mathrm{~cm}$",
    "image": null
  },
